# Pairs with ExpiredEventuallyPruned, under the fairness Spec asserts. The
# plan treats a policy with only one of keep-last and max-age set as the
# unbounded no-op, so nothing is ever pruned under it.
MODULE: ExpiredEventuallyPrunedOneKnobUnbounded
TARGET: ExpiredEventuallyPruned
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: a policy with one knob set retains everything
PERTURBS: PruneList

--- FIND
             IF pol.keepLast = 0 /\ pol.maxAge = 0
             THEN cat
--- REPLACE
             \* MUTATION: one unset knob means unbounded.
             IF pol.keepLast = 0 \/ pol.maxAge = 0
             THEN cat
--- END